{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57200","headline":"十四科头 生死不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 生死不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世间诸法如幻，生死犹若雷电。\n法身自在圆通，出人山河无间。\n颠倒妄想本空，般若无迷无乱。\n三毒本自解脱，何须摄念禅观。\n只爲愚人不了，从地戒律决断。\n不识寂灭真如，何时得登彼岸？\n智者无恶可断，运用随心合散。\n法性本来空寂，不爲生死所绊。\n若欲断除烦恼，此是无明痴汉。\n烦恼即是菩提，何用别求禅观？\n实际无佛无魔，心体无形无段。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}